        <div class="exp">
          <img class="exp-photo" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0619/6861/3445/files/Jessicabodasphotography-jacques.webp?v=1767053015" alt="Dr. Jacqueline Jacques, ND" loading="lazy">
          <p class="exp-quote">&ldquo;Coastline is what happens when you combine scientific rigor with real-world clinical understanding.&rdquo;</p>
          <p class="exp-name">Dr. Jacqueline Jacques, ND</p>
          <p class="exp-role">Naturopathic Medicine Advisor</p>
        </div>
        <div class="exp">
          <img class="exp-photo" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0619/6861/3445/files/Nic_Portrait.webp?v=1767053015" alt="Dr. Nicolas Verhoeven, PhD" loading="lazy">
