  {% render 'cc-ingredients-accordion', ing_eyebrow: 'The formula', ing_heading: '13 ingredients, chosen by scientists.', ing_lede: 'Each one earned its place through the research, at a dose you can actually see. Tap any one to read why the team put it in.' %}

  <div class="band">
    <div class="band-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>13 ingredients.<br>Every milligram on the&nbsp;label.</h2>
        <p>No proprietary blend, no hidden doses. You see exactly what the scientists chose &mdash; and exactly how much.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="#pricing-product-apr26">Buy Coastline Now</a>
